ckly the remaining supply enters circulation and how much is economically liquid.","Whether post-incident safeguards eliminate reorg-prone recovery paths under correlated L1-provider failures."],"lessons_learned":["Validity protects correctness but does not guarantee availability or prevent soft-confirmation reorgs.","A differentiated VM creates technical moat and developer-acquisition cost at the same time.","Token governance and sequencer decentralization should be evaluated as separate maturity tracks."],"could_differ":"EVM equivalence might have accelerated porting and liquidity, but would have weakened Cairo as the organizing technical advantage.","outlook":{"bull":"Decentralized sequencing stabilizes and Cairo applications convert the proof-system moat into durable demand.","base":"Starknet remains a meaningful specialist L2 with modest liquidity and ongoing operational hardening.","bear":"Liveness incidents, unlocks, and Cairo friction keep usage below competing L2s.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["validity_rollup","cairo_specialization","sequencer_decentralization","liveness_risk","token_dilution"],"confidence":"high"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":88,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["capital.network_total_raised_usd","capital.treasury_usd","team.regulatory_status","risk.audit_status","risk.archived_sanctions_check","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}},{"chain":"Ink","source_catalog":{"announce":{"title":"Kraken announces Ink","url":"https://blog.kraken.com/news/announcing-ink"},"launch":{"title":"Kraken Ink mainnet launch","url":"https://blog.kraken.com/news/ink-mainnet-launch"},"about":{"title":"Ink official architecture overview","url":"https://docs.inkonchain.com/general/about"},"faq":{"title":"Ink official FAQ and token status","url":"https://docs.inkonchain.com/faq"},"superchain":{"title":"Ink and the Optimism Supercha