mes can broaden compatibility while increasing operational and user complexity.","Architecture simplification creates migration risk that must be tracked as a lifecycle event.","Stablecoin supply, DEX volume, and DeFi TVL can diverge sharply."],"could_differ":"Keeping CosmWasm and IBC would preserve ecosystem continuity, but it would retain code, tooling, and integration complexity opposed to the EVM-scale thesis.","outlook":{"bull":"Giga lands safely and converts strong stablecoin activity into durable EVM application liquidity.","base":"Sei completes the migration and remains a high-throughput EVM niche below peak TVL.","bear":"Migration friction and execution risk erode developers and strand legacy value.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["parallel_evm","architecture_pivot","sip3","migration_risk","performance_competition"],"confidence":"high"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":86,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["capital.treasury_usd","capital.round_level_breakout","team.additional_founders","team.regulatory_status","risk.audit_status","risk.archived_sanctions_check","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration","synthesis.legacy_asset_migration_completion"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}},{"chain":"Unichain","source_catalog":{"introduce":{"title":"Uniswap Labs introduces Unichain","url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/introducing-unichain"},"launch":{"title":"Unichain mainnet launch","url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/unichain-mainnet-is-here"},"whitepaper":{"title":"Unichain whitepaper","url":"https://docs.unichain.org/whitepaper.pdf"},"fault_proofs":{"title":"Unichain mainnet fault-proof roadmap","url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/wen-unichain-mainnet"},"tee":{"title":"Unichain TEE block building","url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/rollup-boost-is-live-on-unichain"},"flashblocks":{"title":"Unichain Flashblocks production launch","url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/flashblocks-are-live"},"tvl"