 on the as-of date; the peak-to-current TVL comparison does not attribute the decline to a single cause."},"team":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","founders":[{"name":"Hayden Adams","role":"whitepaper author and Uniswap founder","prior":"created the Uniswap protocol","source_url":"https://docs.unichain.org/whitepaper.pdf"}],"entity":"Uniswap Labs develops Unichain and contributes to the OP Stack; the Uniswap Foundation supports ecosystem development.","key_events":[{"date":"2024-10-10","type":"announcement","description":"Uniswap Labs introduced the chain and open-sourced its stack components.","source_url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/introducing-unichain"},{"date":"2025-02-11","type":"launch","description":"Uniswap Labs launched Unichain mainnet.","source_url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/unichain-mainnet-is-here"}],"regulatory_status":null},"narrative":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","purpose":"Create a low-latency Superchain L2 optimized for DeFi market efficiency, fair ordering, and cross-chain liquidity.","positioning":"A protocol-distributed DeFi L2 using the OP Stack, TEE block building, and 200ms Flashblocks.","competitors":[{"name":"Ink","relationship":"DeFi-focused Superchain L2 competitor"},{"name":"Base","relationship":"distribution-led Superchain L2 competitor"},{"name":"Arbitrum","relationship":"established DeFi liquidity and execution competitor"}],"narrative_arc":"Unichain translated Uniswap''s protocol distribution into a dedicated execution venue, shipped fault proofs and fast TEE ordering, but peak liquidity did not persist.","media_sentiment":"mixed"},"risk":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","exploits":[],"sanctions":{"flagged":false,"detail":"No chain-level designation is asserted; an archived exact-name SDN review remains an explicit gap."},"extraction_flags":["centralized_sequencer","tee_dependency","bridge_risk","liquidity_drawdown","protocol_concentration"],"audit_status":null,"risks":[{"type":"sequencer_liveness","detail":"Permissionless fault proofs constrain invalid state but do not remove centralized-sequencer liveness and censorship exposure.","source_url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/wen-unichain-mainnet"},{"type":"tee_trust","detail":"TEE block building improves verifiability of ordering but adds hardware, attestation, and implementation assumptions; the design explicitly does not replace decentralized consensus.","source_url":"https://blog.uniswap.org/introducing-unichain"},{"type":"validation_maturity","detail":"The whitepaper''s UNI-staked UVN is a distinct validation layer whose current production participation and security budget are not established by the reviewed launch materials.","source_url":"https://docs.unichain.org/whitepaper.pdf"}]},"synthesis":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","situation":"Unichain produces $235.4M in 30-day DEX volume but retains only $27.3M TVL, 97.0% below its July 2025 peak; sequencer revenue is small relative to gross fees.","postmortem":null,"why":"Unichain gained immediate usage because Uniswap could route its own protocol, wallet, and developer ecosystem into an OP Stack chain built specifically around market latency and ordering.","success_mechanism":"Uniswap distribution plus 200ms Flashblocks and TEE priority ordering can improve execution and LP responsiveness while Ethereum and the Superchain supply settlement and interoperability.","strategic_choices":["Use the OP Stack and ship permissionless fault proofs at mainnet.","Separate TEE block building from sequencing to make ordering policy attestable.","Use ETH for gas and treat UNI-staked validation as an overlay rather than launch a new chain token."],"unknowns":["Current sequencer, upgrade-key, UVN-validator, and application-TVL concentration.","How much DEX volume is organic versus routed, incentivized, or concentrated in Uniswap deployments.","Why peak TVL left and what share can return without incentives."],"lessons_learned":["Protocol distribution can bootstrap volume faster than it creates sticky TVL.","Fast preconfirmations, Ethereum finality, and UVN attestations are different guarantees.","TEE-enforced ordering reduces one MEV surface while adding hardware-attestation dependencies."],"could_differ":"A standalone stack could tailor consensus and value capture further, but would forfeit OP compatibility and delay production.","outlook":{"bull":"Uniswap routing, UVN maturity, and Superchain interop rebuild sticky liquidity around fast execution.","base":"Unichain stays a high-volume, low-TVL specialized venue integrated with Uniswap.","bear":"Liquidity remains fragmented and TEE/sequencer dependencies limit independent adoption.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["protocol_distribution","op_stack","flashblocks","tee_ordering","liquidity_retention"],"confidence":"high"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":82,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["capital.total_raised_usd","capital.treasury_usd","team.regulatory_status","risk.audit_status","risk.archived_sanctions_check","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration","synthesis.current_uvn_and_upgrade_key_concentration","synthesis.volume_incentive_attribution"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}}]')
),
dossiers AS (
  SELECT value AS dossier FROM dossier_seed, json_each(dossier_seed.payload)
),
dimension_rows AS (
  SELECT
    json_extract(dossier, '$.chain') AS chain,
    dimensions.key AS dimension,
    dimensions.value AS data,
    (SELECT json_group_array(json(json_extract(dossier, '$.source_catalog.' || source_keys.value)))
     FROM json_each(json_extract(dossier, '$.dimension_sources.' || dimensions.key)) AS source_keys) AS sources
  FROM dossiers, json_each(json_extract(dossier, '$.dimensions')) AS dimensions
),
meta_rows AS (
  SELECT
    json_extract(dossier, '$.chain') AS chain,
    '_meta' AS dimension,
    json_extract(dossier, '$.meta') AS data,
    (SELECT json_group_array(json(value))
     FROM json_each(json_extract(dossier, '$.source_catalog'))) AS sources
  FROM dossiers
)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO chain_facts (chain, dimension, data, sources, updated_at)
SELECT chain, dimension, data, sources, '2026-07-29' FROM dimension_rows
UNION ALL
SELECT chain, dimension, data, sources, '2026-07-29' FROM meta_rows;
